From: Jan-Michael Brummer <jan.brummer@tabos.org>
Subject: [PATCH] AVRCP cover art sender, adapted for Compas firmware

Based on upstream BlueZ v3 cover-art series (2026-09-07), commit
f564a391812ee22092d379939d4d55ca74a44afa, PR #2500:
https://github.com/bluez/bluez/pull/2500

Backported to BlueZ 5.87 after the repository AVDTP/volume patches.
Firmware adaptations: asynchronous fixed MPRIS provider discovery,
private JPEG cache access, mandatory 200x200 thumbnails, authenticated
L2CAP transport, image-handle cleanup, replay existing PSM listeners,
and prefer the complete Compas provider over the vendor fallback.

